                <pb facs="0020" n="10" sameAs="frus:frus1864p1/pg10"/>

                <head>The Foreign Enlistment Act.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">60 <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >St. Vincent Crescent, Glasgow,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-11-30"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >November</hi> 30</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir: As</hi> bearing upon the known wholesale
                    violations of the foreign enlistment act by agents and officers of the United
                    States government, I submit as matter of public interest at this time the
                    following official documents which have come into my hands.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>JAMES SMITH.</signed></closer>



